[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_EQUIP_MAGIC]
Canned Magic

[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_EQUIP_MAGIC_desc]
Before modern magic theory, noob magicians experienced live magic performances in the presence of other audience members, to impress the target audience. \nNow, noob magic soliders experience live warfares using magic energy stored in jam jars, to recreate this similar atmosphere, to impress the “target” audience, in one way or another.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_EQUIP_MAGIC]
罐装魔法

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_EQUIP_MAGIC_desc]
在现代魔法理论出现之前，菜鸟魔法师们通过在其他观众面前进行现场魔法表演，给目标观众留下深刻印象。\n而现在，菜鸟魔法士兵们则使用罐装的魔法能量来再现这种氛围进行现场战争表演，给“目标”观众留下深刻印象，虽然“印象”有时候过于深刻。

